<title>USA: Louisville feeder cattle steady-off $1 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Louisville feeder cattle steady-off $1 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feeder steers and heifers were steady to $1.00 per cwt lower, compared to last week's close, USDA said.</p>
<p>Feeder Steers - Medium and Large 1 600-700 lbs 55.00-63.00; 700-800 lbs few 57.00-58.50. Medium and Large 2 500-600 lbs 46.50-54.50.</p>
<p>Feeder Heifers - Medium and Large 1 600- 700 lbs 50.00-53.00. Medium and Large 2 500- 600 lbs 36.50-45.50. Cattle and Calves Receipts - 2,800</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
